#//// Neoffice — MEDIA IS NEVER COMMITTED. The dataset's 1,324 GIFs and JPEGs are
#//// © Gym visual, redistributed with permission INSIDE the dataset repository —
#//// not inside ours. Committing them here, in a PUBLIC repository, would be
#//// redistribution plain and simple. The instance downloads them
#//// (scripts/fetch-media.sh), exactly as upstream's `docker compose up` does for
#//// a self-hoster.
opengym/public/media/

#//// Neoffice — the COMPILED journal IS committed (opengym/public/frontend): the
#//// fleet never rebuilds a SPA on an instance.
frontend/dist/
